# Atomic Design & Native UI Craft Rules

- Consult `skills/abeta-kmp-atomic/SKILL.md` and `agents/owners/{design-tokens,sdui-contracts,ui-atoms,sdui-layout,storybook}-owner.md`.
- Preserve strict Atomic/Action separation: `ui-atoms` emits `ActionRef` and `LocalUiHapticFeedback` only—never imports `core`, `action-engine`, `network`, or `sdui-layout`.
- Native iOS & Android Craft (`/impeccable`):
  - Every interactive element meets `ThemeTokens.sizing.minTouchTarget` (`48.dp`, satisfying iOS `44 pt` & Android `48 dp`).
  - Use semantic `ThemeTokens.colors` & `sp` typography—zero raw hex colors or fixed `px`.
  - Honor `WindowInsets.safeDrawing`, `statusBarsPadding()`, `navigationBarsPadding()`, and `imePadding()`.
  - Honor `ThemeTokens.motion.reducedMotion` on all animations and `LiveRegionMode.Polite` on offline/toast banners.
- Register every snippet via `SnippetRegistry` (OCP) and verify with `compose.uiTest` (`UiAtomsComposeTest`, `SduiScreenComposeTest`, `StorybookComposeTest`).
